# P6-v2 on WSL GtkBackend (P6-v2 is the GTK counterpart of P6): Sound, Frame drop, then the Speed and FPS drop-downs by keyboard, as actions/mac/P6-transport-toggles.actions. Positions from the AT-SPI dump under WSLg (x11) of 2026-10-20, client coordinates, origin empty: row y 218, Sound 77, Frame drop 175; drop-downs y 174, Speed 391, FPS 502.
# Pass: the status reports Sound and Frame drop on, and the speed and rate changed from 1x and 60.
# P6-v2(WSL):Sound、Frame drop,再用鍵盤操作 Speed 與 FPS 下拉選單。通過條件見上方英文。
